name: test_verify_ellipsis

nodes:
  - name: codes
    type: Map
    inputs:
      - documents

  - name: verify
    type: VerifyQuotes
    window_size: 300
    ellipsis_max_gap: 3
    trim_spans: true
    inputs:
      - codes

---#codes

Extract themes with quotes. Use ellipsis (...) for long quotes to show where you've skipped text. Only include direct quotes from the text above.

<text>
{{input}}
</text>

[[codes:codes]]
